<p>Arbayee'n hai tera mere bhaya husain<br />
______________________________</p>

<p>1. Haye kadiyal jawaa'n, khayi usne sina<br />
Ek kohram tha bain arzo samaa<br />
Qabre akber pe jab aayi sab bibiyaa<br />
______________________________</p>

