<p>2. Qasime qastatan haye gul pairahan<br />
Zindagi me hua uska paamaal tan<br />
Haye bewa hui ek shab ki dulhan<br />
______________________________</p>

<p></p>

<p>3. shaamo koofa se jab hum guzaare gaye<br />
Naam le kar waha'n sab pukaare gaye<br />
Kisko aawaz doo'n sab to maare gaye<br />
______________________________</p>

<p></p>

<p>4. Mere bhaya mere dil me armaan tha<br />
